#. <CLT 23>そのプレゼントは渡す事ができません。<CLT>
#. <CLT 3>“重要アイテム”<CLT><CLT 23>ですので…<CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sorry, but we can't let you give her that. It's what\n"
"we in the industry like to call a<CLT> <CLT 3>key item<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>渡すプレゼントを選択してくださいませ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>What would you like to give her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やりぃ！　超うれしいんですけど！
#. 苗木って気が利くじゃーん！
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Uwaaah! Damn, Makoto! You've got pretty good taste!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しは喜んでくれたかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean she liked it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. マジで！？　くれんの！？
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "This is just for me!?"
msgstr ""

#. アハハッ！　お礼にチューしてあげよっか！？
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Heh-heh! Lemme give you a little peck on the cheek to\n"
"say thanks!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>良かった。
#. どうやら喜んでくれたみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I get the impression that she liked it. That's good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木…下心があるんじゃないの…？
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Admit it, Makoto. You didn't just give me this to be\n"
"nice, did you...?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、あたし的にはいいけどね！
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Well, whatever! Works for me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここまで喜んでもらえると、
#. あげたこっちも嬉しくなるよな…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seeing Junko so pleased with something I gave her\n"
"makes me happy!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ…
#. これって、あげる人を間違えてない？
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Hey, uh...you sure you meant to give this to me?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Hrmm..."
msgstr ""

#. ナシ…かな…？
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Um...no?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しまった…
#. がっかりさせちゃったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh-oh... I don't think she was too happy with that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何それ？　ダサくね？
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "What the hell? This is friggin' lame..."
msgstr ""

#. ぶっちゃけ、センスないよね？
#. 苗木ってさ…
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "I've never met someone with such god-awful taste."
msgstr ""

#. 何コレ…
#. マジでキモいんですけど…
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "This is like, totally gross."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怒らせちゃったみたいだ…
#. 印象が悪くなっちゃったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...think I made her mad. She probably thinks worse of\n"
"me now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり渡す
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Maybe not..."
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼントを渡さなくてもよろしいですか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Are you sure you don't want to give her something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
